Third-party attribution
=======================

This project is licensed under the Eclipse Public License 2.0; see LICENSE. It
was zlib until 2026-09-05, chosen to match raylib itself. EPL 2.0 relicenses
nothing that arrived under another licence: the whole is EPL 2.0 and each part
below keeps what it came with. raylib and its examples remain zlib, which is
permissive and imposes no condition EPL 2.0 conflicts with, so the combination
distributes cleanly as long as their notices travel with it. That is what this
file is for.

This repository holds the examples that were split out of b12n-oss/raylib-jnk
on 2026-10-05, one Leiningen project per example, with the shared helpers in
common/ and the raylib asset submodule at the root. Every notice below
travelled here with them.

Two obligations survive the licence change and are easy to lose: zlib asks that
the origin not be misrepresented, and that altered versions be plainly marked.
The example ports and the rlights port below satisfy the marking in their
docstrings, and they still have to.

An earlier version carved out two MPL 2.0 files inherited from a vendored -sys
wrapper; that wrapper is gone, replaced by the official
org.jank-lang.commons/raylib-sys package, so the carve-out went with it.

